{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50276","headline":"俯吐蕃禁门观田判官赠向将军真言口号（项云「俯」当作「附」，下夺「近」字，「附近」爲接近、靠近之意。） · 马云奇","name":"俯吐蕃禁门观田判官赠向将军真言口号（项云「俯」当作「附」，下夺「近」字，「附近」爲接近、靠近之意。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怪来偏得主君怜，料取分明在眼前。\n说相未应惊䴏鴒，看心且爱直如弦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马云奇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50276.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50276","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}